expect:
  Killed by tst_syncengine.qml, two tests at once:
  test_a_quiet_fold_lands_its_correction_without_a_rebuild (no PW_LBSWAP
  is issued and _combineReloopBusy stays false) and
  test_three_checks_that_agree_correct_the_map_without_a_sound (same
  missing swap on the ordinary desk). Line-neutral.
